# TouchType Academy — Interactive Typing Course on Portfolio

Build the entire `touch-typing.md` curriculum as a fully interactive, playable course on the portfolio website, complete with a virtual keyboard visualizer, progress/gamification system, and all 4 screen types (Block Letters, Falling Letter, Game in Tree, Standard Drill).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a large feature.** I'll build it in 4 phases, each producing a working, non-breaking commit. Each phase builds on the previous one. You can test after each phase.

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> **No new npm dependencies required.** Everything will be built with React, existing Tailwind CSS, and vanilla JS. The only dependency already in use is `lucide-react` for icons.

## Proposed Changes

We'll build this as a **self-contained module** — new files only, minimal edits to existing files — so nothing breaks.

