#### [NEW] [TypingExercise.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gasig/Documents/my_projects/gasigwa-portfolio/src/components/typing/TypingExercise.jsx)

- The core engine — enhanced version of existing `TypingPractice.jsx` (existing component stays untouched)
- Supports 4 modes:

| Screen Type        | Behavior                                                                   |
| ------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Block Letters**  | Large monospace text, slow single-key focus, gentle highlighting           |
| **Falling Letter** | Rapid sequence, compact layout, speed-focused with timer pressure          |
| **Game in Tree**   | Tree-shaped visual layout (centered, cascading rows), top-to-bottom typing |
| **Standard Drill** | Normal paragraph flow, real words/sentences                                |

- Shared logic: character-by-character matching, cursor position, real-time WPM/accuracy, backspace support
- Visual feedback: correct (green), incorrect (red), current cursor (blue pulse), untyped (gray)
- Completion: confetti-style animation, stats summary, "Next Screen" button

