### Phase 3: Virtual Keyboard Visualizer + Gamification

#### [NEW] [VirtualKeyboard.jsx](file:///c:/Users/gasig/Documents/my_projects/gasigwa-portfolio/src/components/typing/VirtualKeyboard.jsx)

- SVG/CSS-based QWERTY keyboard rendered below the exercise
- Features:
  - **Finger color-coding**: Each finger gets a unique color zone (left pinky = rose, left ring = orange, etc.)
  - **Active key highlight**: Currently expected key glows/pulses
  - **Finger indicator**: Shows which finger to use with a label
  - **Home row markers**: F and J keys have bump indicators
  - **Key press animation**: Brief scale + color flash on correct press
  - **Learned vs. unlearned keys**: Learned keys are bright, unlearned keys are dimmed
- Responsive — collapses on mobile with a "Show Keyboard" toggle

#### [NEW] [useTypingProgress.js](file:///c:/Users/gasig/Documents/my_projects/gasigwa-portfolio/src/hooks/useTypingProgress.js)

- Custom React hook for localStorage-based progress tracking
- Stores per-step/per-screen: `{ completed: bool, bestWpm: number, bestAccuracy: number, attempts: number }`
- Exposes: `getStepProgress()`, `markScreenComplete()`, `getOverallProgress()`, `resetProgress()`
- Step unlocking logic: Step N+1 unlocks when Step N is completed (all screens done)

#### Progress & Gamification UI (integrated into existing pages):

- **Step cards** on course page show: ⭐ stars (based on accuracy), 🔒 locked / ✅ completed / 🔵 current
- **Stats summary** on step completion: WPM, accuracy, time, personal best comparison
- **Course progress bar**: animated fill showing X/20 steps complete
- **Achievement badges** (stretch): "Home Row Hero", "Top Row Explorer", "Speed Demon (>40 WPM)"

