# TouchType Academy Implementation Summary

The TouchType Academy has been successfully integrated into your portfolio! The entire 20-step curriculum is now an interactive, gamified learning experience directly accessible from the home page.

## What Was Accomplished

### 1. Data Layer & Curriculum

- Created `src/data/typingCourseData.js` parsing the entire 3,400+ lines of your markdown into a structured format.
- Includes all **20 steps**, covering the home row, top row, bottom row, numbers, capital letters, and full speed practice.
- Supports 4 specific exercise modes for variety.

### 2. Progress Engine

- Created `src/hooks/useTypingProgress.js`.
- Implemented robust `localStorage` tracking for best WPM, accuracy, and attempts per screen.
- Includes step-locking logic ensuring users must master foundational keys before advancing.

### 3. Application Routing & Pages

- **Course Landing Page**: `TypingCoursePage.jsx` provides a beautiful dashboard tracking overall progress and listing the 20 steps.
- **Step Overview Page**: `TypingStepPage.jsx` dives into learning goals and specific exercises.
- **Exercise Wrapper**: `TypingExercisePage.jsx` houses the active typing session and keyboard toggle.
- Added a custom card on `HomePage.jsx` driving users straight to the course.

### 4. Interactive Typing Engine (4 Modes)

- **Standard Mode**: Continuous flow typing for building speed.
- **Block Letters Mode**: Renders single isolated keys as large blocks to force absolute focus on new finger movements.
- **Falling Letter Mode**: Provides a smooth scrolling ticker-tape layout, enforcing steady rhythm.
- **Game In Tree Mode**: Arranges keys in a vertical tree pattern, improving look-ahead reading skills.
- Implemented a unified `useTypingEngine` hook that powers all these variations with strict error and WPM calculations.

### 5. Interactive Virtual Keyboard

- Created `VirtualKeyboard.jsx` utilizing custom color-coding mapped to the standard touch-typing finger assignments.
- Includes active event listeners that physically depress and light up keys on screen exactly when you type them.

> [!TIP]
> **Next Steps for You:** Run the app locally (`npm run dev`) and test out the new `TouchType Academy` card on the home page. You can click through Step 1 exercises and watch the progress bars and locks update in real time!

